{
  "type": "Collection",
  "id": "GEOS-CF_v2_virtual",
  "stac_version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "VEDA/GMAO Icechunk stores over a GEOS-CF v2 air-quality subset (analysis and forecast streams). Bucket is in us-east-1. Chunks are read from the public NCCS THREDDS HTTPS server, so no login is needed anywhere. Several generations coexist and no canonical prefix is documented; geos-cf-v2-dev (Icechunk v2 layout) is marked latest here. xpystac 0.5 cannot open these because the chunk container is HTTPS, not S3: configure icechunk.VirtualChunkContainer('https://ds.nccs.nasa.gov/thredds/fileServer/', icechunk.http_store()).\n\nStatus (probed 2026-11-06): Early development; v2-dev 2026-04-24, prod 2026-04-03.",
